    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <p
      style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-mute); margin-top: 24px;"
    >
      Calculations are estimates. Live mid-market exchange rates fetched automatically. Fixed monthly plans spread costs across sales volume.
      <a href="/guide" style="color: var(--color-link);">Learn more in our guide</a>
